ull, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Verified during testing: Reordering Education section (moved up before Work Experience) updated preview immediately without page refresh. Toggling Skills section visibility (hidden) updated preview immediately. Section order remained preserved throughout session as confirmed by multiple preview checks showing correct order.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Verified during testing: Entered data in Contact tab (Jane Smith, emails, phone, location). Navigated to Summary tab and entered professional summary. Returned to Contact tab and all previously entered data (Jane Smith, phone, location) remained intact. Moved to Experience, Education, Skills tabs - all data retained. Dashboard showed updated timestamps (Aug 24, 2026) after edits.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Marketing Manager Resume (Classic style) preview renders all 5 visible sections with content: (1) Contact Information (Sarah Chen, email, phone, location, LinkedIn), (2) Professional Summary, (3) Work Experience (2 positions with dates, company, descriptions), (4) Education (2 degrees with dates, schools), (5) Skills. All sections displayed in preview with complete data. Content is readable and accessible; preview layout accommodates all sections.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Verified during testing: Entered contact details (Jane Smith, jane@example.com, (555) 987-6543, New York), professional summary, work experience (Senior Project Manager at Tech Solutions Inc., Jan 2020 - Dec 2023 with description), education (Stanford University, MBA, Sep 2018 - Jun 2020), and skills (Project Management, Leadership). All data persisted when switching between Contact→Summary→Experience→Education→Skills tabs and remained visible in preview.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Verified during testing: Duplicated \\\"Untitled Resume\\\" to create \\\"Tech Startup Application\\\". Modified copy's email from \\\"jane@example.com\\\" to \\\"startup@techstartup.com\\\". Verified original \\\"Untitled Resume\\\" retained original email \\\"jane@example.com\\\" unchanged. Confirmed editing copy did not affect original, and they remain as independent variations with distinct data.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Verified during testing: Renamed \\\"Untitled Resume (Copy)\\\" to \\\"Tech Startup Application\\\". The new title \\\"Tech Startup Application\\\" appeared: (1) in the header/editor area as the active resume title, and (2) on the dashboard card as the heading. Renamed title was consistently displayed across both the editor and dashboard UI.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Verified during testing: Customized \\\"Work Experience\\\" section heading to \\\"Professional Experience\\\" in the Sections tab. The customized heading \\\"Professional Experience\\\" appeared in the preview for the Minimal template style where the section was visible. This confirms custom section headings are rendered in the resume preview with the user-specified text.\"}]}"
